                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "First of all, the applicants have to go to the nearest office of the Agriculture Department"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "list_item"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Now applicants have to ask for the application form for Samagra Gramya Unnayan Yojana"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "list_item"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Applicants have to fill out this application form by entering all the required details"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "list_item"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Now applicants have to attach all the required documents"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "list_item"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "After that, applicants  have to submit this form to the agriculture Department"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "list_item"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "By following this procedure applicant  can apply under Samagra Gramya Unnayan Yojana"
                      }
                    ],
                    "type": "list_item"
                  }
                ],
